{"Title":"An Act authorizing the commissioner of capital asset management and maintenance to issue a confirmatory deed for a certain parcel of land in the city of Marlborough","BillNumber":"H4943","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"H34","Name":"House Committee on Ways and Means","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34","ResponseDate":"2024-07-30T12:18:06.84"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DWG1","Name":"Danielle W. Gregoire","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DWG1","ResponseDate":"2024-06-27T20:06:48.4966667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4943/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":null,"DocumentText":null,"EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to authorize forthwith the issuance of a confirmatory deed by the commonwealth of a certain parcel of land in the city of Marlborough, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[{"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Branch":"Senate","RollCallNumber":240,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Branches/Senate/RollCalls/240"}],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}